er you find out some of the items worth a deeper exploration, you can click into the item and check detailed information of the item there.","DESC_CATEGORY":"On the category analysis page, you can see the sales rankings of various categories on the {{region}} TikTok site. These e-commerce category names match the official e-commerce category names of {{region}} TikTok. You can find the fastest-growing industries on the {{region}} TikTok site, or industries with relatively fewer shops, or industries with relatively less competitive pressure. Through the above analysis, you can find the blue ocean industries on the {{region}} TikTok site, and further find the best-selling shops, hot selling products, popular influencers, etc. within the industry. This information can help you decide whether to enter and sell in this industry and help you formulate your product selection strategies and content marketing strategies.","DESC_SHOP":"On the shop list page, you can see the rankings of top e-commerce shops on the {{region}} TikTok site. You can also further filter to find brand stores or retail stores within the shop list. With this ranking, you can analyze the sales growth trends, average customer spend, number of influencers collaborated with, and hot-selling products of these shops, thereby determining whether it's worth learning from their business model.","DESC_CREATOR":"On the creator list page, you can see the ranking of top e-commerce influencers on the {{region}} TikTok site. Further, you can filter for influencers who run their own businesses (store owned accounts) and those available for partnerships (affiliate influencer). If you are a merchant, you can partner with affiliate influencer. You can also filter influencers by followers count to find influencers who may not have a large following but have rapidly increasing revenues. These influencer are known as KOC. Additionally, it's possible to find influencers' contact information and only collaborate with those who have provided contact methods. You can also differentiate and filter between video and live-streaming revenues, thereby enriching your partnership methods with influencers who have high video sales. With this ranking, you can establish influencer collaborations and identify successful accounts from other businesses to learn from their content strategies.","DESC_PRODUCT":"On the product list page, you can see the rankings of top products on the {{region}} TikTok site. You can also filter for livestream products or short video products to locate items suitable for live stream or video sale. If you're an influencer, you can filter affiliated products through their affiliation status - these are products directly available for influencers to sell. Most importantly, you can sift out products that are experiencing recent sales growth trends. With these capabilities, you can easily spot potential blockbuster products in the  {{region}} TikTok site for follow-up sales execution.","DESC_VIDEO":"On the video list page, you can see the sales ranking of the Top e-commerce or trendy products videos from the  {{region}} TikTok site. Furthermore, you can find videos where the sales are continuously increasing. Focusing on creating these types of videos tends to yield more viral hits. What's unique is that you can filter out advertisement videos, and even identify those with high return on investment (ROI), allowing you to refer to these high-ROI advertising videos when placing TikTok video ads. There are also some additional fun uses, such as the ability to filter recently launched video accounts and to identify videos that truly garner significant traffic from these hot accounts. The video list page holds tremendous value for users seeking inspiration for TikTok videos.","DESC_LIVESTREAM":"On the livestream list page, you can see the sales rankings of the top e-commerce livestreams on the {{region}} TikTok platform. Within these livestreams, you can filter out videos with live